.5771-25/499619680_1393935745408106_5227587196332653476_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7msRt-nGqA8Q7kNvwEtawf1&_nc_oc=AdojXdyHFESr3jEioCgsxYkHAGg3Hm0-Q-8wzJ5a1eHES9gs4LV4WZS3aVfDsgGDkcE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEWV4lpmD-HZ-jqPpVUAh3LyQ6N6u6XQgZebEmzcG57Xg&oe=6A918F2F"}, "display_name": "God of Bath", "keywords": ["Fighting", "battle", "action", "korea", "Comics"], "long_description": "\u201cGOD OF BATH\u201d is a VR adaptation of the popular Korean webtoon The God of Bath.\n\nPlayers use real hand movements to attack and defend in a unique \u201cScrub Fighting\u201d combat system.\n\nThe immersive VR \u201cScrub Time\u201d sequences recreate iconic scenes from the webtoon with a comedic twist, delivering both laughter and excitement.\n\nExperience a new world of VR action comedy filled with dynamic battles, realistic scrubbing action, and unforgettable characters.\n\n\u25a0 Key Features\n{1337823384203149}\n* Scrub Battle Action \u2013 A one-of-a-kind combat system powered by real scrubbing moves!\n{841894742141525}\n* Comedic Scrub Time \u2013 Relive iconic webtoon moments as interactive VR events!\n{1589004808932841}\n* Face Off Against Original Characters \u2013 Fight your way through familiar and unforgettable personalities!\n{1521575192738410}\n* Immersive VR Gameplay \u2013 Every movement you make turns seamlessly into combat and comedy!\n{1199671048730157}\n* Experience the most extraordinary battle ever to take place in a bathhouse!\n\n\nOriginal Comics from NAVER WEBTOON \u24d2Ilkwon Ha All Rights Reserved.", "short_description": "Experience the hit Korean webtoon God of Bath in VR!\nStep into a bathhouse where over-the-top comedy meets intense scrubbing battles.\nFeel the thrill of combat powered by scrubbing moves, and dive into hilarious \u201cscrub time\u201d moments you can experience firsthand!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "IMG_0619.png", "id": "4313722828908122", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618472_4313722832241455_8129084445092545218_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SkTF3G1PJ2oQ7kNvwHtqfh0&_nc_oc=Ado1O7gRV1DoCcQIjE4W6YbY_GtRidvBbPTgQ4ZEP08FpGyOCy1lY4CZrDtLH8ZQ3fg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHVSXeAgCiKMINnX94SXzNAxD5JAeArZDWAayAp5JJOAg&oe=6A916041"}, {"file_name": "Cubemap_20251106_095857_nologo.png", "id": "1858878011724015", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620817_1858878015057348_1911355417361916343_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R0ZlnMgiKv0Q7kNvwFtpH-m&_nc_oc=AdrXIqEah1ClvHQevWJTOSl0RuO5hr9q_NT9wOmjK6roNEFyRSunRLXO-F2hFQhsYzY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHE5Il2LVKwYbA6akF2S1RB3zZOPXCZA2jiTevPvcoibQ&oe=6A9174E8"}, {"file_name": "IMG_0620.png", "id": "1547078116625666", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619174_1547078119958999_8403208151240748249_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YTuLD8aBSF4Q7kNvwGTjHlF&_nc_oc=AdqEfp_vcm6sPkvjLW402GAc0t_Lgbbm5Q6l7y6oYY_6mXvhUQrSw0cCrs4mSIuLOag&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE0E2K9RmCHCO3usSaSXD-KsHrBKlKmXrOM_Ej4umUicw&oe=6A915D2E"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover_kr_A.png", "id": "1544914920259210", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618472_1544914923592543_20439413943043317_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hVu5ftATVmkQ7kNvwEybubR&_nc_oc=AdrcdPthq53LjWZ5PMsOKmu1msJSp7j0uar9p-CrJGW_Acwon1nqPP1TWKb9aGd0DZs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGLYVfh7L7DWsnIIyd1zLWJKax1zpPbcveSVwZOh5YBEA&oe=6A91644D"}, {"file_name": "Cover_kr_A.png", "id": "1180716197305101", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t